This program prints four letters, one per line. Write them in order with no spaces (for example `ABCD`).

```dart
import 'dart:async';

void main() {
  print('A');
  Future(() => print('B'));
  scheduleMicrotask(() => print('C'));
  print('D');
}
```

What does this program print?

```dart
Future<int> twice(int n) async => n * 2;

Future<void> main() async {
  final r = await Future.wait([twice(1), twice(2), twice(3)]);
  print(r.reduce((a, b) => a + b));
}
```

What does this program print?

```dart
Stream<int> evens(int max) async* {
  for (var i = 0; i <= max; i += 2) {
    yield i;
  }
}

Future<void> main() async {
  final list = await evens(9).map((n) => n + 1).toList();
  print(list);
}
```

